{{!
    @template mod_vrmakerspace/studio

    The studio: the task strip, the top row (method, undo and redo, save state, the More menu), the tools of the
    Clay (sculpt) and the Shapes (model) method, the 3D canvas with the controls pictures, the help panel and the
    next-step tip, and the status line. The mod_vrmakerspace/studio module binds to it and starts the 3D view;
    mod_vrmakerspace/guide runs the first-use help (tip, pictures, help, saved state, fewer or more tools, the people
    of a group piece, the phone's tool tray).

    Classes required for JS:
    * d-none - hides the parts the studio shows once it knows what the device can do
    * mod_vrmakerspace-basic - on the root: only the basic tools show (elements marked data-advanced hide)

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="mod_vrmakerspace-studioroot" data-title: the studio root and the activity name
    * data-region toolbar, methodswitch, sculptpanel, modelpanel, size, strength, shapeoptions, shape, textfield, text,
      segments, stage, canvas, loading, nowebgl, failed, bakeconfirm, statustext, message, openedges, sculpthelp, modelhelp,
      vrhelp, vrmodelhelp; exportmenu, addshapemenu, selectmodes, axislock (what the tutorial's steps point at)
    * data-region goal, savedstate, legend, helppanel, hint, members, modelscroll, segmentsbox, segmentslabel, tray,
      filegroup, showme
      (the guide)
    * data-action tool (with data-tool), mirror, undo, redo, save, export (with data-format), vr, fullscreen,
      method (with data-method), selectmode (with data-mode), select (with data-select), addshape (with data-shape),
      modelaction (with data-tool), axis (with data-axis), oneshot (with data-oneshot), bakeconfirm, bakecancel, tutorial,
      moretools, help, hidehint, showme
    * data-advanced - a tool or heading that only shows with More tools

    Context variables required for this template:
    * readonly - true when the piece can only be looked at
    * title - the activity name
    * piecetitle - whose piece this is, and which version (plain text): the page's heading
    * backurl - the activity page
    * methods - the ways of making the activity allows: both, sculpt or model
    * cansculpt - true when the activity has the Sculpt method: without it, the Sculpt controls are not rendered
    * canmodel - true when the activity has the Model method: without it, the Model controls are not rendered
    * showmethodswitch - true when there is a choice of method
    * modelfirst - true when the studio opens in the Model method
    * tutorial - true in tutorial mode for someone who can work on the piece: the Tutorial button shows
    * goal - the task strip: name, intro (plain text, may be empty), facts (list of {text})
    * hints - the next-step tips, plain text: clay, claydone, clayempty, claymesh, shapespick, shapesact, shapesdone,
      shapesempty
    * emptystart - true when the piece starts from nothing
    * meshstart - true when the piece starts from a polygon cube (no clay)
    * lastsaved - when the piece was last saved (unix time, 0 when never)
    * hasmembers, members - the people of a group piece: list of {name, you}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "readonly": false,
        "title": "Make a head",
        "piecetitle": "Your piece",
        "backurl": "https://example.com/mod/vrmakerspace/view.php?id=2",
        "methods": "both",
        "cansculpt": true,
        "canmodel": true,
        "showmethodswitch": true,
        "modelfirst": false,
        "tutorial": false,
        "goal": {"name": "Make a head", "intro": "A head with two ears.", "facts": [{"text": "Saves itself every minute"}]},
        "hints": {"clay": "Drag on the clay.", "claydone": "Nice.", "shapesdone": "Done.", "clayempty": "Empty.", "claymesh": "No clay yet.", "shapespick": "Click a side.",
            "shapesact": "Drag it.", "shapesempty": "Empty."},
        "emptystart": false,
        "meshstart": false,
        "lastsaved": 0,
        "hasmembers": true,
        "members": [{"name": "Sam", "you": true}, {"name": "Alex", "you": false}]
    }
}}
<div class="mod_vrmakerspace-studio{{^readonly}}{{^tutorial}} mod_vrmakerspace-basic{{/tutorial}}{{/readonly}}"
        data-region="mod_vrmakerspace-studioroot" data-title="{{title}}"{{#readonly}} data-readonly="1"{{/readonly}}
        {{#tutorial}} data-tutorial="1"{{/tutorial}}>
    <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-header d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2" data-region="goal">
        <h3 class="{{^readonly}}visually-hidden{{/readonly}}{{#readonly}}h5 mb-0{{/readonly}}">{{#readonly}}<span class="badge text-bg-dark me-2">{{#str}} studio_readonly, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>{{/readonly}}{{piecetitle}}</h3>
        {{#goal}}
            <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-goal flex-grow-1">
                <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-goalname"><strong>{{#str}} goal_label, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}:</strong> {{name}}</span>
                {{^tutorial}}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary rounded-pill ms-2 py-0" data-action="showme"
                        aria-expanded="false">{{#str}} showme_button, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                {{/tutorial}}
                {{#intro}}<span class="mod_vrmakerspace-goalintro"> &mdash; {{intro}}</span>{{/intro}}
                <ul class="mod_vrmakerspace-goalfacts list-inline small text-muted mb-0">
                    {{#facts}}<li class="list-inline-item">{{text}}</li>{{/facts}}
                </ul>
            </div>
        {{/goal}}
        {{#hasmembers}}
            <ul class="mod_vrmakerspace-members list-inline small mb-0" data-region="members"
                    aria-label="{{#str}} presence_label, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">
                {{#members}}
                    <li class="list-inline-item mod_vrmakerspace-member{{#you}} mod_vrmakerspace-here{{/you}}" data-name="{{name}}"
                            data-you="{{#you}}1{{/you}}{{^you}}0{{/you}}"
                            data-here-label="{{#str}} presence_here, mod_vrmakerspace, {{name}} {{/str}}"
                            data-away-label="{{#str}} presence_away, mod_vrmakerspace, {{name}} {{/str}}"
                            title="{{#you}}{{#str}} presence_you, mod_vrmakerspace, {{name}} {{/str}}{{/you}}{{^you}}{{#str}} presence_away, mod_vrmakerspace, {{name}} {{/str}}{{/you}}">
                        <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-membername">{{#you}}{{#str}} presence_you, mod_vrmakerspace, {{name}} {{/str}}{{/you}}{{^you}}{{name}}{{/you}}</span>
                    </li>
                {{/members}}
            </ul>
        {{/hasmembers}}
        <a class="ms-auto" href="{{backurl}}">{{#str}} back, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</a>
        {{#goal}}
        {{^tutorial}}
        <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-showme d-none w-100" data-region="showme" aria-label="{{#str}} showme_title, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">
            <ol class="list-unstyled mb-0 mod_vrmakerspace-showme-model">
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 22l16-8 16 8-16 8z" fill="#f5a25d"/><path d="M16 22v20l16 8V30z" fill="#7d9dbf"/><path d="M48 22v20l-16 8V30z" fill="#6b8aac"/></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_shapes_1, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 10l16-8 16 8-16 8z" fill="#f5a25d"/><path d="M16 10v32l16 8V18z" fill="#7d9dbf"/><path d="M48 10v32l-16 8V18z" fill="#6b8aac"/><path d="M58 40V12" stroke="#d63384" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M54 17l4-5 4 5" stroke="#d63384" stroke-width="2"/></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_shapes_2, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 10l16-8 16 8-16 8z" fill="#9fc4ec"/><path d="M16 10v32l16 8V18z" fill="#7d9dbf"/><path d="M48 10v32l-16 8V18z" fill="#6b8aac"/><path d="M48 26l10-5v12l-10 5z" fill="#f5a25d"/><path d="M48 26l10-5" /></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_shapes_3, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
            </ol>
            <ol class="list-unstyled mb-0 mod_vrmakerspace-showme-sculpt">
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 40c-4-8 0-18 9-20 4-7 15-6 18 1 7 3 7 14 0 18-6 5-21 6-27 1z" fill="#c08a64"/><path d="M24 20c4-6 10-7 14-3" stroke="#d29a6c" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_clay_1, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 40c-4-8 0-18 9-20 4-7 15-6 18 1 7 3 7 14 0 18-6 5-21 6-27 1z" fill="#c08a64"/><path d="M30 34c3 2 7 2 10 0" stroke="#7a5236" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_clay_2, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
                <li class="mod_vrmakerspace-showmestep"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" width="64" height="56" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#1d2125" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="32" cy="32" rx="19" ry="14" fill="#c08a64"/><path d="M22 26c4-3 12-4 18-1" stroke="#e0b48f" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>{{#str}} showme_clay_3, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        {{/tutorial}}
        {{/goal}}
    </div>

    <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-toolbar btn-toolbar d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2" role="toolbar"
            aria-label="{{#str}} tools, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}" data-region="toolbar">
        {{^readonly}}
            {{#showmethodswitch}}
            <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-methods btn-group d-none" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}} methods, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                    data-region="methodswitch">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark{{^modelfirst}} active{{/modelfirst}}" data-action="method" data-method="sculpt"
                        aria-pressed="{{^modelfirst}}true{{/modelfirst}}{{#modelfirst}}false{{/modelfirst}}"
                        title="{{#str}} method_sculpt, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (Tab): {{#str}} tip_method_sculpt, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                        aria-keyshortcuts="Tab">{{#str}} method_sculpt, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark{{#modelfirst}} active{{/modelfirst}}" data-action="method" data-method="model"
                        aria-pressed="{{#modelfirst}}true{{/modelfirst}}{{^modelfirst}}false{{/modelfirst}}"
                        title="{{#str}} method_model, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (Tab): {{#str}} tip_method_model, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                        aria-keyshortcuts="Tab">{{#str}} method_model, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
            </div>
            {{/showmethodswitch}}
            <div class="btn-group mod_vrmakerspace-undoredo" role="group">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="undo" disabled
                        title="{{#str}} tip_undo, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"><span class="mod_vrmakerspace-iconlabel">{{#str}} undo, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="redo" disabled
                        title="{{#str}} tip_redo, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"><span class="mod_vrmakerspace-iconlabel">{{#str}} redo, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span></button>
            </div>
            <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-savedstate small" data-region="savedstate" data-lastsaved="{{lastsaved}}"
                    data-never="{{#str}} savedstate_never, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                    data-saved="{{#str}} savedstate_saved, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                    data-justnow="{{#str}} savedstate_justnow, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                    data-pending="{{#str}} savedstate_pending, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"></span>
        {{/readonly}}
        <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-toolgroup mod_vrmakerspace-filegroup" data-region="filegroup" data-advanced="1">
            <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-grouplabel small text-muted">{{#str}} group_file, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
            {{^readonly}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="save"
                    title="{{#str}} tip_savenow, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} savenow, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
            {{/readonly}}
            <div class="dropdown">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary dropdown-toggle" id="{{uniqid}}-export" data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                        data-region="exportmenu" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false"
                        title="{{#str}} tip_export, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} export, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                <ul class="dropdown-menu" aria-labelledby="{{uniqid}}-export">
                    <li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="export" data-format="stl">{{#str}} export_stl, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="export" data-format="glb">{{#str}} export_glb, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="export" data-format="3mf">{{#str}} export_3mf, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="fullscreen" aria-pressed="false">{{#str}} fullscreen, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary d-none" data-action="vr" aria-pressed="false">{{#str}} entervr, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
        {{^readonly}}
            {{#tutorial}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-info" data-action="tutorial" aria-pressed="false">{{#str}} tutorial_button, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
            {{/tutorial}}
            {{^tutorial}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary mod_vrmakerspace-moretools" data-action="moretools" aria-pressed="false"
                    data-more="{{#str}} tools_more, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}"
                    data-fewer="{{#str}} tools_fewer, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tools_more, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
            {{/tutorial}}
        {{/readonly}}
        {{^readonly}}
            {{#cansculpt}}
            <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-panel{{#modelfirst}} d-none{{/modelfirst}} d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2" data-region="sculptpanel">
                <div class="btn-group flex-wrap" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}} tools, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="add"
                            aria-pressed="true" title="{{#str}} tool_add, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (3): {{#str}} tip_tool_add, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_add, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="carve"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_carve, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (4): {{#str}} tip_tool_carve, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_carve, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="smooth"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_smooth, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (5): {{#str}} tip_tool_smooth, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_smooth, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="grab"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_grab, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (1): {{#str}} tip_tool_grab, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_grab, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="twist" data-advanced="1"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_twist, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (2): {{#str}} tip_tool_twist, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_twist, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="inflate" data-advanced="1"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_inflate, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (6): {{#str}} tip_tool_inflate, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_inflate, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="pinch" data-advanced="1"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_pinch, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (7): {{#str}} tip_tool_pinch, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_pinch, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="flatten" data-advanced="1"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_flatten, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (8): {{#str}} tip_tool_flatten, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_flatten, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                </div>
                <div class="btn-group flex-wrap" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}} modellingtools, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="shape"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_shape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (9): {{#str}} tip_tool_shape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_shape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="tool" data-tool="cutshape" data-advanced="1"
                            aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}} tool_cutshape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (0): {{#str}} tip_tool_cutshape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} tool_cutshape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                </div>
                <div class="d-none d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2" data-region="shapeoptions">
                    <label class="mb-0" for="{{uniqid}}-shape">{{#str}} shape, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
                    <select class="form-select w-auto" id="{{uniqid}}-shape" data-region="shape">
                        <option value="sphere">{{#str}} shape_sphere, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                        <option value="cube">{{#str}} shape_cube, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                        <option value="cylinder">{{#str}} shape_cylinder, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                        <option value="cone">{{#str}} shape_cone, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                        <option value="torus">{{#str}} shape_torus, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                        <option value="text">{{#str}} shape_text, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="d-none d-flex align-items-center gap-2" data-region="textfield">
                        <label class="mb-0" for="{{uniqid}}-text">{{#str}} shapetext, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control w-auto" id="{{uniqid}}-text" data-region="text" maxlength="16"
                                size="12" value="ABC" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
                    </span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-action="mirror" aria-pressed="false" data-advanced="1"
                        title="{{#str}} mirror, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (M): {{#str}} tip_tool_mirror, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} mirror, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-slider d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <label class="mb-0" for="{{uniqid}}-size">{{#str}} brushsize, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
                    <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-sliderend small text-muted" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} slider_small, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                    <input type="range" class="form-range" id="{{uniqid}}-size" data-region="size" min="4" max="80" step="1"
                            value="20">
                    <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-sliderend small text-muted" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} slider_big, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-slider d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <label class="mb-0" for="{{uniqid}}-strength">{{#str}} brushstrength, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</label>
                    <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-sliderend small text-muted" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} slider_gentle, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                    <input type="range" class="form-range" id="{{uniqid}}-strength" data-region="strength" min="5" max="100"
                            step="5" value="50">
                    <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-sliderend small text-muted" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} slider_strong, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/cansculpt}}
            {{#canmodel}}
            <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-scrollwrap{{^modelfirst}} d-none{{/modelfirst}}" data-region="modelscroll">
            <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-panel mod_vrmakerspace-modelpanel{{^modelfirst}} d-none{{/modelfirst}} d-flex align-items-center gap-2"
                    role="group" aria-label="{{#str}} method_model, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}" data-region="modelpanel">
                <div class="mod_vrmakerspace-toolgroup">
                <span class="mod_vrmakerspace-grouplabel small text-muted" data-advanced="1">{{#str}} group_change, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</span>
                <div class="btn-group" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}} modelactions, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="modelaction" data-tool="select" aria-pressed="true" data-advanced="1"
                            title="{{#str}} action_select, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}: {{#str}} tip_action_select, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}">{{#str}} action_select, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="modelaction" data-tool="move" aria-pressed="false"
                            title="{{#str}} action_move, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (G): {{#str}} tip_action_move, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}" aria-keyshortcuts="G">{{#str}} action_move, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="modelaction" data-tool="extrude" aria-pressed="false"
                            title="{{#str}} action_extrude, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (E): {{#str}} tip_action_extrude, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}" aria-keyshortcuts="E">{{#str}} action_extrude, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="modelaction" data-tool="scale" aria-pressed="false"
                            title="{{#str}} action_scale, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}} (S): {{#str}} tip_action_scale, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}" aria-keyshortcuts="S">{{#str}} action_scale, mod_vrmakerspace {{/str}}</button>
